      hg lam S O' hlamO' chig hchig iota hlamM hunit O'' K _hsmul TM _hT A hA (W ⊓ V0)
      (fun ℓ hℓ hℓN hℓS u hu => _hHecke ℓ hℓ hℓN hℓS u hu.1)
      (fun u hu => _hTlam u hu.1) inf_le_right

